# A 3D fix with nine satellites (HDOP 2.4: about 12 m): the dot, the ring, "3D fix 9 sats". Zoomed in and out the ring
# follows the ground; kilometres by default.
title GPS: 3D fix, nine satellites
sizes 640x480 480x320 320x480
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_GPS auto
env DECKATLAS_GPS_FEED fix3d
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.889643,2.269995,16

wait 1500
shot fix-3d
expect text "Map"
type -
wait 1200
shot fix-3d-z15
